<section id="S4" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">4 </span>Experiments</h2>

<figure id="S4.T1" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="S4.T1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Comprehensive benchmark results on the LLaDA-Instruct suite. Each cell presents the accuracy and the decoding throughput in tokens per second with relative speedup to the LLaDA baseline (bottom row, <span id="S4.T1.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">blue: tokens per second</span>/<span id="S4.T1.6.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">orange: relative speedup</span>). The highest throughput and speedup for each configuration are highlighted.</span></figcaption>
<table id="S4.T1.7" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S4.T1.7.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.7pt 3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Benchmark</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.7pt 3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.7.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Gen Length  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.7pt 3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.7.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">LLaDA</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.7pt 3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.7.1.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">+Cache</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.7pt 3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.7.1.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">+Parallel</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.7pt 3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.7.1.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">+Cache+Parallel (Fast-dLLM)</span></td></tr>
