<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Comprehensive benchmark results on Dream-Base variants over four tasks with different generation lengths (256 and 512).
Each cell shows accuracy (top row) and decoding throughput in tokens per second with relative speedup to Dream-Base baseline (bottom row, <span id="S4.T2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">blue: tokens per second</span>/<span id="S4.T2.7.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">orange: relative speedup</span>).
Numbers in <span id="S4.T2.7.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFCC;">yellow indicate the highest throughput and speedup per configuration.
</span></span></figcaption>
